TruePix
=======

This product includes software developed for the TruePix verifiable video
editing protocol.

TruePix core (`TruePix-main/`, `VideoEdition/`) is derived from the Hyrax
interactive-proof codebase (https://github.com/hyraxZK), with substantial
modifications and new code for the TruePix protocol.

